=== history-revision {id="20260831T092506Z-56384579" parent="20260831T090953Z-bdf7fe20" summary="§3.1: type gets its own TYPE-NAME production, narrower than NAME" hash="sha256:56384579cdc93e415a571f68bfe672e5ab2aa74e664e9b250614b1434cd4bcbe" newline="lf"}
